    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A new story? How? The characters are all dead. The world I knew is gone. It's not a stillness, it's just... emptiness. I'm just holding this sword and realizing it's the only thing in this whole world that still feels real. It's the only thing that doesn't lie to me or promise things it can't deliver. It's honest. It's just cold, hard steel.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
